{"evt":"note_created","id":"note-mqenb2pth7k","workspace":"/Users/imyu/Desktop/zonoid","title":"bench 4arm runner fix: arms 1 to 3 must use arm on not arm off for context injection to activate","summary":"bench-4arm-runner.js called bench-arm.js with arm=\"off\" for all 4 arms. Context injection in bench-arm.js is ON-arm-only, so flags --with-global-summary and --with-window were no-ops. Fix: arm0=off (baseline control), arm1/2/3=on (ON preamble + injection active). Re-run needs ≥3 trials and a harder problem set (not just greenfield which is ceiling-effect). The 4arm-runner.js also needs a token-cost capture step using bench-economy.js for the weighted_cost win criterion.","created_by":"main","valid_from":"2026-06-15T03:20:25.217Z","vec":[-0.04569229111075401,0.035543277859687805,0.011049940250813961,-0.014066149480640888,-0.033654775470495224,-0.014512100256979465,-0.04138660803437233,0.028177540749311447,-0.00954407174140215,0.0255680363625288,-0.047163475304841995,-0.025776924565434456,0.01887611486017704,-0.037685323506593704,0.034857384860515594,0.07843655347824097,0.11705169826745987,0.01920440047979355,-0.006780995521694422,0.013933188281953335,-0.009761041030287743,-0.07239887118339539,0.08822205662727356,-0.010673752054572105,0.001965721370652318,-0.03586120158433914,-0.11431337893009186,0.015369035303592682,0.052761852741241455,0.012099002487957478,0.03671049699187279,-0.006813144311308861,-0.073182612657547,-0.06970074027776718,0.0005030735628679395,0.0629177913069725,-0.021385541185736656,-0.03972095996141434,-0.06605083495378494,0.06326188892126083,0.08334482461214066,-0.0018629388650879264,-0.05343521386384964,0.008462716825306416,0.04136645793914795,0.054671190679073334,-0.06125538796186447,-0.007633870001882315,0.004818979185074568,-0.026249825954437256,-0.05088157206773758,-0.03787079080939293,0.05084111914038658,-0.07740295678377151,-0.03523086756467819,0.0463460348546505,0.018539169803261757,0.03505953401327133,-0.011251522228121758,0.05860103666